flowchart TB
  C["Start here: controller<br/>One scheduler, sole signal and reap owner<br/>No filesystem call from readiness to publication end"]:::start
  O["Outbox<br/>Serialised frames, at most 64 MiB"]
  E["Evidence writer<br/>Fresh interpreter, own session, cwd /<br/>Owns run directory and every evidence descriptor"]
  S[("Evidence storage<br/>May stall or fail")]
  T["Workload and teardown commands<br/>stdin null, stdout and stderr pipes, cwd /"]
  W["Inspection worker<br/>Unchanged inspection contract"]
  C -->|"1. Enqueue immutable records"| O
  O -->|"2. Nonblocking frame writes"| E
  E -->|"3. Blocking open, write, read, hash"| S
  E -.->|"4. Acknowledgements by sequence number"| C
  C -->|"Starts, drains pipes, signals, reaps"| T
  C -->|"Requests, closes, reaps"| W
  C -->|"KILL by frozen PID while unreaped, exact-PID reap"| E
